---
import BaseLayout from './BaseLayout.astro';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  path: string;
  heading: string;
}

const { title, description, path, heading } = Astro.props;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path={path} noindex>
  <section class="section pt-14">
    <div
      class="container max-w-[760px] [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2.5 [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_li]:text-[15px] [&_li]:text-muted [&_p]:my-4 [&_p]:text-[15px] [&_p]:text-muted [&_ul]:my-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-10"
    >
      <h1 class="m-0 mb-[22px] text-[clamp(34px,5vw,52px)]">{heading}</h1>

      <p
        class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-rust bg-rust/8 px-[18px] py-4 text-[15px]"
      >
        <strong>Texto pendiente.</strong> Este contenido debe redactarlo el titular real de la web
        (responsable, finalidad, base jurídica, destinatarios, plazos de conservación y derechos)
        antes de publicar. No publicar la web con este aviso visible.
      </p>

      <slot />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
